# 1. Background
# 1. 背景

### English

The dominant AI paradigm today is based on centralized infrastructure operated by large organizations.

Historically, centralization has provided efficiency and coordination. However, every highly centralized system faces increasing challenges in maintaining diversity, adaptability, and resilience over time.

The emergence of local AI technologies creates an opportunity to rethink how intelligence should be distributed and governed.

